le":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321707011:0":{"text":"お二人の本意……","source_cn":"他们的本心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BC1C4F8EA5F76B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321707012:0":{"text":"……分かりました。では、せめて葬儀の流れを教えてくれませんか？","source_cn":"……我明白了。那就请您告诉我具体的葬礼流程吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5817811B343FED2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321707013:0":{"text":"たしか、ホワイトマウンテンの貴族は氷の棺を使うと聞いたことがある。","source_cn":"我曾听说，白山公国的贵族下葬时会使用冰棺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4617BB683402F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321707014:0":{"text":"その通りです。公国は土葬が主流で、平民は松やヒノキの棺桶、貴族は<style=\"highlight\">特製の氷の棺</style>を使います。","source_cn":"是的。白山公国实行土葬，平民用松木或柏木棺材，贵族则使...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78E54D018A31AEEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321707015:0":{"text":"完成した氷の棺には、修道院が提供する<style=\"highlight\">フロストオイル</style>を塗ります。それによって、棺の氷は永遠に溶けることがなくなります。","source_cn":"冰棺完成后，修道院会提供<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6942F773CB0BFD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"",